 "operation": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.1 Initial Display",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Title 'Route Mileage', breadcrumb 'Master - Route Mileage'.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Input Section in Add Mode: From = 'Select From Location', To = 'Select To Location', Mileage blank.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "From / To list contains only ACTIVE locations of Master Location, shown as 'Code - Name', sorted by code. Location data is not hard-coded.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "d.",
   "text": "Route Mileage List shows all routes (10 rows per page) with the default columns. If none exist, message no. 11.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.2 Location Selection",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Click / focus From or To: open the list. Typing filters by code or name (partial, case-insensitive). Arrow keys + Enter select; Esc closes.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Only listed values can be selected (no free text). Leaving the field without selecting keeps the previous value.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "A location added in Master Location is available in the list immediately; an INACTIVE location is not listed.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.3 Save (Add / Edit)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "items": [
    "Step 1 - Mandatory: From (no. 1), To (no. 2), Mileage (no. 3). Messages are shown under each field. Stop.",
    "Step 2 - From must differ from To (no. 4). Stop.",
    "Step 3 - Mileage numeric and > 0; 0, negative and non-numeric rejected; max 2 decimals (no. 5). Stop.",
    "Step 4 (Add) - From and To must be ACTIVE in Master Location (no. 6); From + To must not exist yet, Active or Inactive (no. 7). Stop.",
    "Step 5 - Save in one DB transaction with audit fields; Edit also checks the version (no. 8). Disable Save while processing.",
    "Success: reset the form to Add Mode, refresh the list, show message no. 9 (Add) / 10 (Edit)."
   ],
   "marker": "1.",
   "level": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Backend validation applies the same rules and messages as the screen.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.4 Edit",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Click a row: From, To, Mileage are loaded; From / To read only; row highlighted (Edit Mode).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Only Mileage can be changed. Created By / Created Date are never overwritten; Updated By / Change Date are set on save.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Cancel discards the change and returns to Add Mode.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.5 Search, Table View, Export",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Search filters immediately on all list columns; no match: message no. 12.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Table View shows / hides columns (Created By, Changed By hidden by default).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Export .xls exports all rows matching Search with the visible columns; Mileage exported as number.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "column_break"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.6 Route Direction and Uniqueness",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "A route is directional: From -> To and To -> From are separate records and may have different mileage.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "columns": [
    {
     "title": "From",
     "width": 8
    },
    {
     "title": "To",
     "width": 8
    },
    {
     "title": "Mileage",
     "width": 8
    },
    {
     "title": "Result",
     "width": 22
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "SNT",
     "KRW",
     "65 KM",
     "Saved"
    ],
    [
     "KRW",
     "SNT",
     "68 KM",
     "Saved (other direction)"
    ],
    [
     "SNT",
     "KRW",
     "70 KM",
     "Rejected, message no. 7"
    ],
    [
     "SNT",
     "SNT",
     "10 KM",
     "Rejected, message no. 4"
    ],
    [
     "SNT",
     "CKR",
     "0 KM",
     "Rejected, message no. 5"
    ]
   ],
   "level": 2,
   "row_lines": "all"
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Unique key = Location From + Location To.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.7 TC-PBR Variable Cost",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "TC-PBR looks up the ACTIVE mileage for the delivery From + To and the applicable Price per KM (Price Master, TBD).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Variable Cost = Mileage (KM) x Price per KM. Example: DPCMR -> CYSTR = 16 KM; SNT -> KRW = 65 KM x IDR 5,000 = IDR 325,000.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Route not found: never use 0 KM. Flag the delivery, show message no. 13 and do not calculate the variable cost until valid mileage exists.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.8 Status (not shown on this screen)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Records are never physically deleted. The requirement defines Active / Inactive with deactivation confirmation; the existing screen has no status column or action, so STATUS is stored as Active (TBD, OP-02).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Inactive mileage stays for history and is not used for new TC-PBR calculations.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.9 Security and Audit",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Access follows the existing role framework (View / Add / Edit / Export Master Mileage, TBD).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Audit fields: Created By, Created Date, Updated By, Change Date.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.10 Excel Upload (MM-20 to MM-29, refer UISS-Batch 'Master Mileage - Route Mileage Upload')",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Download Template: Excel with sheet Route Mileage (header FROM CODE | TO CODE | MILEAGE (KM)), Active Locations and Notes (msg 21).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Upload Excel: the file is checked (type, template columns, 1-1,000 rows; msg 14 / 15 / 16 / 17) and every row is validated with the screen rules (MM-01..MM-03, MM-06), duplicates in the file and inactive existing routes. Nothing is saved yet.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Upload Preview: result per row New (route not existing), Update (existing Active route, other mileage), No change (same mileage), Error (reasons).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "d.",
   "text": "Confirm Upload (only without errors and with New / Update rows): all rows are checked again and saved in one transaction (all-or-nothing); list refreshed, msg 20. With errors: msg 18; nothing to save: msg 19.",
   "level": 2
  }
 ],
